+@@
+
+@RET@		FcBool
+@FUNC@		FcFontSetAdd
+@TYPE1@		FcFontSet *			@ARG1@		s
+@TYPE2@		FcPattern *			@ARG2@		font
+@PURPOSE@	Add to a font set
+@DESC@
+Adds a pattern to a font set.  Note that the pattern is not copied before
